<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Admin Panel • Sambhav Security Lab</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page-shell">
        <nav class="navbar">
            <div class="badge">🧭 Admin Command Center</div>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="/">Home</a>
                <a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a>
                <a href="/blackbox">Black Box</a>
                <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
            </div>
        </nav>

        <header class="hero-card" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
            <h1 class="hero-title" style="font-size:2.2rem;">Restricted Admin Panel</h1>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">Demonstrating broken access control in a tri-colour experience.</p>
            <p>Regular users shouldn’t be here — but due to intentionally weak authorization checks, they can view sensitive
                information. Capture the flag and review exposed controls.</p>
            <div class="hero-tag" style="margin-top:18px;">🚩 Admin Flag: <strong><%= flag %></strong></div>
        </header>

        <section>
            <h2 class="section-title">👥 Full User Directory</h2>
            <table class="table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>ID</th>
                        <th>Username</th>
                        <th>Email</th>
                        <th>Role</th>
                        <th>Created</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <% allUsers.forEach(function(u) { %>
                        <tr>
                            <td><%= u.id %></td>
                            <td><%= u.username %></td>
                            <td><%= u.email %></td>
                            <td><%= u.role %></td>
                            <td><%= u.created_at %></td>
                        </tr>
                    <% }); %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </section>

        <section class="alert" style="margin-top:32px;">
            <h3>🔎 Training Tip</h3>
            <p>Use this panel to illustrate how sensitive admin functionality should be segmented. Add role-based checks, CSRF
                tokens, and least privilege controls in secure environments.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
